{
  "_howto": "Each tool appears in its group (established or predictive) on /calculators/. Established tools link to their own page. Models open a model card at /calculators/model?id=<id>. status: live | in-development | planned. A model is calculated in the browser when it has an 'engine' (see examples/logistic-model-example.json), or embedded when it has an 'embedUrl' (e.g. a shinyapps.io app). Leave a field empty to hide it. Models built from ACS NSQIP data need \"dataSource\": \"nsqip\" so the NSQIP disclaimer is shown. Search uses 'conditions' and 'procedures' (shown as the reason a calculator matched) and 'keywords' (synonyms and abbreviations).",
